# patterns.db - Attack Signature Database
# Project Sentinel - Plaintext Pattern Database
#
# Format: one pattern per line (case-insensitive matching is applied automatically)
# Lines starting with '#' are comments and are ignored by the engine.
#
# Categories:
#   [SQLi]  - SQL Injection attempts
#   [LFI]   - Local File Inclusion / Path Traversal
#   [XSS]   - Cross-Site Scripting
#   [CMD]   - Command Injection
#   [SCAN]  - Known scanner/bot signatures

